   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SRSA IAP BiH 2000</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SRV IOP BiH 2000</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet &#xE4;r en forts&#xE4;ttning p&#xE5; de integrerarde omr&#xE5;desprogram R&#xE4;dd- ningsverket genomf&#xF6;r i Tuzla-regionen sedan 1995. Projektet avse rehabilitering av 350 hus, samt lokal infrastruktur, f&#xF6;r minoritets- &#xE5;tervandring i Doboj, Zvornik samt Zivinice. Projektet omfattar MSEK 29,54, och ber&#xE4;knas genomf&#xF6;ras under 2000-2001.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is a continuation of the integrated area projects SRSA have done in the Tuzla region since 1995. It aims at reconstruction foreturning minorities to Doboj, Zvornik and Zivinice. Project cost is MSEK 29,54, implementation period 2000-2001</narrative>
  </description>
